            <h2 class="cs-font_36 mb-4">Advantage+ Shopping Campaigns (ASC) vs Manual Testing</h2>
            <p>To avoid polluting proven baseline campaigns, we implement a two-tier account structure:</p>
            <ol style="margin-left: 20px; line-height: 1.8;">
