              <li><strong>The ASC Scaling Engine:</strong> Once a creative angle produces verified post-click purchases or qualified sales leads at or below target CPA for 7 consecutive days, it is graduated into the primary Advantage+ campaign with expanded budget allocation.</li>
            </ol>

            <h2 class="cs-font_36 mb-4">High-Ticket B2B Lead Funnels: Eliminating Junk Leads</h2>
            <p>Running Meta Ads for high-ticket services often results in a flood of low-intent, unqualified leads if set up improperly. To ensure sales teams receive high-value opportunities, we implement strict qualification gates:</p>
            <ul style="line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px; margin: 20px 0;">
              <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><strong>Higher-Intent Native Forms:</strong> Enabling Meta's review step and asking 2-3 custom friction questions (e.g. "What is your monthly ad spend budget?" or "How many team members need access?").</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><strong>Instant CRM Webhook Routing:</strong> Streaming new lead submissions into HubSpot or Slack within 15 seconds, triggering an immediate automated SMS and calendar booking link.</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><strong>Offline Conversion Feedback:</strong> Feeding closed deal data back to the Meta Conversions API via CRM integration so Meta's algorithm optimizes for closed revenue rather than cheap form fills.</li>
